cff-version: 1.2.0
title: KI-Inventar
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as part of the SimpleAct AI Governance Framework."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: SimpleAct-Compliance
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimpleAct-Compliance/simpleact-ai-system-inventory"
license: MIT
abstract: "A method for building an AI system register under Regulation (EU) 2024/1689: one entry per use case rather than per tool, five discovery sources that each surface what the others miss, and a search log that evidences completeness instead of asserting it. Covers embedded AI in purchased software, the Art. 25 role switch a register has to catch, provider-side model changes and how to notice them, and the oversight metric that reveals whether Art. 14 supervision is actually exercised."
keywords:
  - EU AI Act
  - GDPR
  - AI inventory
  - AI register
  - shadow AI
  - embedded AI
  - Article 25
  - Article 14
  - AI governance
  - SimpleAct
